WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.783
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:08.580
Hi Rob, this is Tyler
calling from North Dakota,

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:09.930
I'm a big fan.

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.370
I love the podcast.

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:13.740
I just got done watching all the episodes

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:16.030
of "The Lowe Files"
with you and your boys.

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:18.060
And I got to say it was really fun

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.600
and it was great to watch.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:20.560
I'm just curious.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:24.100
Are there any topics or
anything else that you wish

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.650
that you guys had covered
on "The Lowe Files"

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:29.040
of you and your boys
before it went off the air?

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:29.900
Thank you very much,

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.120
and keep up the good work.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:31.953
Hey, Howard.

00:00:31.953 --> 00:00:32.927
Thank you.

00:00:32.927 --> 00:00:34.790
First of all, thank you for
watching "The Lowe Files."

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:36.469
It was really a labor of love.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:37.650
I mean, let's face it,

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:40.890
any dad who has the
opportunity to run around

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:42.720
in a souped up truck

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:45.650
with their boys solving
supernatural mysteries

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:48.188
is going to jump at the chance as I did.

00:00:48.188 --> 00:00:49.210
Oh yeah.

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:51.950
There's so much more
stuff that I wanted to do.

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:54.320
We were going to go to Hawaii and

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:59.150
and do the Menehunes
and the Night Marchers.

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:01.181
So the Night Marchers
are spirits that march up

00:01:01.181 --> 00:01:06.181
and down the Island of the big
Island with torches at night.

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:09.581
And if you look at them, they kill you.

00:01:09.581 --> 00:01:12.570
And the Menehunes, are little tiny

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:16.420
like elves that run around and play tricks

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:20.660
on you and put your shoes in
the wrong room or steal things.

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:24.960
They're sort of like
mischievous little elves.

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.610
So that also, by the way

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:29.920
it would have been a great
excuse to go to Hawaii.

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:33.870
I mean, there was the,
the secret space force.

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:35.090
We did a little bit of that.

00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:35.923
I'm fascinated.

00:01:35.923 --> 00:01:39.101
I wanted to go to Mount
Shasta to look at the

00:01:39.101 --> 00:01:43.410
the supposed giants that
live inside the mountains.

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:47.250
And apparently when certain
clouds come over Mount Shasta

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.451
which only happen on
Mount Shasta, apparently

00:01:49.451 --> 00:01:53.310
that's when the space ship
is there loading people

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:54.143
in and out.

00:01:54.143 --> 00:01:54.976
Oh yeah.

00:01:54.976 --> 00:01:56.160
You heard me.

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:58.150
These are the things that supposedly go

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:01.780
on that may or may not
be complete bullshit

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:03.901
and "The Lowe Files"
was there to find out.

00:02:03.901 --> 00:02:06.920
Maybe, I want to do more "Lowe Files."

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:08.280
Maybe one day we'll get to do it

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:09.630
but I love that you watched it.

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:12.283
And those would've been the
next things we would've done.

